Upstream-Name: sparky-ca
Upstream-Contact: Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Source: https://github.com/Sparky-OS/sparky-ca
Comment: Sparky CA was created in 2018 by Paweł "pavroo" Pijanowski for SparkyLinux.
 Daniel Campos Ramos updated its certificates in 2020 and rebuilt it in 2026.
 The 2026 code, tests and translations were written with the assistance of
 AI models, which the project's commit messages name.

