Copyright: public data published by their issuers
License: public-domain
 These are public certificates published by Instituto Nacional de Tecnologia
 da Informação (ITI) and by the public certification authority named in
 each file. They are redistributed unchanged so that the program can verify
 downloads without relying on the network. The fuzzing corpus holds inputs
 that libFuzzer derived from these certificates and from public TEST seeds.

Files: ed521-provider/tests/data/rfc8032-ed448.json
Copyright: 2017 IETF Trust and the persons identified as the document authors
Comment: The Ed448 and Ed448ph test vectors of RFC 8032 (Simon Josefsson and
 Ilari Liusvaara), sections 7.4 and 7.5, extracted unchanged as data. The
 RFC is subject to BCP 78 and the IETF Trust's Legal Provisions, which give
 code components extracted from it the Simplified BSD License (section 4.e).
